   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppn&#xe5;dda resultat</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODHAG has accompanied human rights defenders working to manage local conflicts between communities and private sector related to the use of land and natural resources. Legal and psycosocial support has been provided to human rights defenders, including cases of criminalization. The work included capacity bulding on environmental rights in relation to protection of land and territorries, and the right to water. Through strenghtening community networks people have been able to design strategies for advocacy and for legal action.</narrative>
   </description>
